      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont want to go to a doctor right now, its too expensive and i dont have time for the waiting room. u said it's probably just the coffee or the magnesium. do u think i could just take some more magnesium or maybe a bit of beta blocker if i have some left over from my brother? i just want to stop the racing feeling tonight so i can sleep. what's the safest dose to just knock it out?",
